  "text": "erev tove, Captain May-eer!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-57980c48",
  "text": "lyla tove, Captain! One quick mission before bed?",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-94135f0a",
  "text": "Captain May-eer! You're back!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-94135c83",
  "text": "Hebrew reads this way . English reads this way !",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-18ce5124",
  "text": "Banana is banana in Hebrew too!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-3678ae16",
  "text": "oh-toe-boos in Hebrew is bus in English. Almost the same!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-ddea50f7",
  "text": "When friends in gahn say toe-dah, in English you say thank you!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-1b9b9346",
  "text": "sah-bah-bah means cool. In English, cool means cool!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-0cc1ffe4",
  "text": "Your name, May-eer, means “giving light.” Shine on, Captain!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-9fe9c837",
  "text": "In Hebrew, keh-lev. In English, dog. Woof!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-81b8d8be",
  "text": "bah-bah-yeet means “at home.” Base bah-bah-yeet is our home base!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-beb6f4ba",
  "text": "Ice cream in Hebrew is glee-dah. Astronauts love glee-dah.",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-f30d3efa",
  "text": "Real rockets need fuel. Our rocket runs on reading!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-85e865e2",
  "text": "Great job, Captain!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-8b948cf0",
  "text": "coal ha-kah-vode!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-dc811cc3",
  "text": "Yes!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-5f4b02ac",
