  "key": "rex-cd148e62",
  "text": "Glitch trapped Lev on Planet sheh-mesh! We have to save him, Captain May-eer!",
  "v": "rex"
 },
 {
  "key": "rex-7dfec218",
  "text": "May-eer, you moved to Israel. mah-zahl tove! Now our rocket needs English power. Tap each crystal to learn your first sounds.",
